[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     38[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// binary must behave the same as the one cargo builds for the test run. This
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     39[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// guards against a profile-dependent difference (overflow checks, for
