[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     77[0m:[38;5;10m[49m which wraps identically in the release profile but panics whenever
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     78[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `overflow-checks` is on. The behaviour of the translation therefore depended on
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     79[0m:[38;5;10m[49m which profile it was built with, and only the release profile happened to agree
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     80[0m:[38;5;10m[49m with the C.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     81[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
