[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    156[0m:[38;5;10m[49m on an instrumented copy of the C sources (built in `/tmp`, leaving `c_src/`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    157[0m:[38;5;10m[49m untouched): **96.75 % line coverage, 554 lines**.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    158[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    159[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Menu dispatch: empty input, bare newline, non-numeric, leading whitespace, sign,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    160[0m:[38;5;10m[49m leading zeros, trailing junk, embedded NUL, `0`, `13`, negative, `INT_MAX`,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    161[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `INT_MIN`, values that overflow `long`, `2^32`, lines at and over the 255-byte
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    162[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `fgets` limit, EOF with no trailing newline.
