[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    171[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    172[0m:[38;5;10m[49m File I/O: save with no scenes, a bad index, EOF before the filename, an empty
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    173[0m:[38;5;10m[49m filename, a missing directory, `.`, `..`, a directory, a read-only file,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    174[0m:[38;5;10m[49m truncation of a longer existing file, a subdirectory, a non-UTF-8 filename, a
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    175[0m:[38;5;10m[49m filename containing NUL, an empty scene and a full 50-shape scene. Load with a
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    176[0m:[38;5;10m[49m missing file, a directory, an empty file, a name-only file, an unparsable count,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    177[0m:[38;5;10m[49m a count larger than the number of entries, a negative / zero / `+`-signed /
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    178[0m:[38;5;10m[49m padded / saturating / `INT_MAX` count, a float count, CR-LF, all entries on one
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    179[0m:[38;5;10m[49m line, tabs, trailing garbage, an empty name line, a NUL in the name, no newline
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    180[0m:[38;5;10m[49m anywhere, names at 62/63/64/100 bytes, a 63-byte name whose 64th byte is a
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    181[0m:[38;5;10m[49m digit, out-of-range and overflowing shape types, more than 50 entries, a full
